      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova, in i Mungu para; abidodi, abipaku nyingi; kum itimo gin ma wang’u ijo, cil lembapora ma con, ibedo mandha i lemandha de. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum idwoko adhura ni udhuru, man adhura ma tek ni susu, ot ma ber mi juwirok ubedo ni adhura ngo; jubigome kendo ki ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno dhanu ma tek biyungi; adhura mi thek mi ndiri bilwori ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum ibedo ka ma tek ni jucan, ka ma tek ni jucanpiny i can pare, kavogo ni wavuvu, tipopiny ni lietho, kinde ma atido mi ju mi ndiri bedo calu wavuvu kum gang’kidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibijwigo badwand juwirok piny calu lietho i ka m’uthwo calu lietho ni kum tipopiny mir afuru, jubijwigo wer mi jundiri piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yehova mir udul bitimo agba mi gin ma mio ni kodhidhanu ceke wi got maeni, agba mi pigulok wi thing’, mi gin ma mio pong’ ku mio mi cogo, mi pigulok wi thing’ ma judwoko leng’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebinyotho wang’ girauma m’uumo kodhidhanu ceke wi got maeni, ku bongu m’auma ma jupedho wi thek ceke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
