                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum cing’ Yehova biyom i got maeni; man jubinyono Moab piny i kakare, cil calu junyono soka i pi mir udhuru mi weyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ebirieyo cinge i diere, calu ng’atu ma kwang’ rieyo cinge kara ekwang’; ento Yehova bijwigo kuhaya pare piny karacelo ku bodho mi cinge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebirwombo ot ma tek mi gang’kidi peri piny, apedha piny, aredha de i ng’om, cil i utur.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
